    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="band">
        <h1>sqlite3_driver_forge <span class="t-red">quick start</span></h1>
        <p class="lede">
          A background-isolate driver over package:sqlite3 for the forge
          packages. It owns the connection lifecycle, serializes every access
          through one connection on a dedicated worker isolate, and implements
          both forge executor contracts at once, with SQLCipher support.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">
          <span class="ver">0.1.0</span>
          <a href="https://pub.dev/packages/sqlite3_driver_forge">pub.dev</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/albetnov/forge-flutter/tree/main/packages/sqlite3_driver_forge">README source</a>
        </div>
      </div>

